{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1381071,\"title\":\"Godzilla Minus Zero\",\"tagline\":\"There is no third time. Everything ends here.\",\"overview\":\"War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hSmIJluOJmTWvJs4d7kHRxjc8s8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqrYIDH4tvfEzPe1yqT4jzmAWHQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":287,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":135,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"budget\":15000000,\"revenue\":104182654,\"director\":\"Takashi Yamazaki\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":43652,\"name\":\"Takashi Yamazaki\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uMBvVGGHRupMpnkdveXdWA0oZwC.jpg\"},{\"id\":225730,\"name\":\"Ryunosuke Kamiki\",\"character\":\"Kōichi Shikishima\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ut7ewXjdgUmgkhJ1EtbOo9tbc7s.jpg\"},{\"id\":1516266,\"name\":\"Minami Hamabe\",\"character\":\"Noriko Shikishima\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eQN8N2chINckvQDiNqzDXI0v9vN.jpg\"},{\"id\":111691,\"name\":\"Hidetaka Yoshioka\",\"character\":\"Kenji Noda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xWNS6qStVthhWoxmKDfNS729BjJ.jpg\"},{\"id\":136191,\"name\":\"Min Tanaka\",\"character\":\"Kanji Murakami\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bXmBnejA48Da7LzLdJqTKSVPCwd.jpg\"},{\"id\":87637,\"name\":\"Masami Nagasawa\",\"character\":\"Makoto Aoyama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvHhfDOral1DeyBRSzpxsoHz60t.jpg\"},{\"id\":1161474,\"name\":\"Yuki Yamada\",\"character\":\"Shiro Mizushima\",\"photo\"