re when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":315011,\"title\":\"Shin Godzilla\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jPNShaWZMpVF0iQ7j1dvTuZLD20.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tb0uo01w2kDHiQwTszsLlSusAm4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a massive, gilled monster emerges from the deep and tears through the city, the government scrambles to save its citizens. A rag-tag team of volunteers cuts through a web of red tape to uncover the monster's weakness and its mysterious ties to a foreign superpower. But time is not on their side - the greatest catastrophe to ever befall the world is about to evolve right before their very eyes.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":72190,\"title\":\"World War Z\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aCnVdvExw6UWSeQfr0tUH3jr4qG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kg2FOT2Oe5PSCgs3L4vLel6B7ck.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Life for former United Nations investigator Gerry Lane and his family seems content. Suddenly, the world is plagued by a mysterious infection turning whole human populations into rampaging mindless zombies. After barely escaping the chaos, Lane is persuaded to go on a mission to investigate this disease. What follows is a perilous trek around the world where Lane must brave horrific dangers and long odds to find answers before human civilization falls.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460458,\"title\":\"Resident Evil: Welcome to Raccoon City\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7uRbWOXxpWDMtnsd2PF3clu65jc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wYtEvBmpBRXPdwGgr1gcWiwJSI7.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Once the booming home of pharmaceutical giant Umbrella Corporation, Raccoon City is now a dying Midwestern town. The company’s exodus left the city a wasteland…with great evil brewing below the surface. When that evil is unleashed, the townspeople are forever…changed…and a small group of survivors must work together to uncover the truth behind Umbrella and make it through the night.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":345940,\"title\":\"The Meg\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eyWICPcxOuTcDDDbTMOZawoOn8d.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ibKeXahq4JD63z6uWQphqoJLvNw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A deep sea submersible pilot revisits his past fears in the Mariana Trench, and accidentally unleashes the seventy foot ancestor of the Great White Shark believed to be extinct.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1196067,\"title\":\"Worldbreaker\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ahj1JU8r0uJv7QII5Uj7tKzbEsC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gMItMzDOyrfQGZsMWRM9tdxq5cV.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Five years ago, a tear in the fabric of reality brought creatures to our world from an alternate dimension bent on our destruction. A father hides his daughter on an island to keep her safe while he prepares her for survival and the battles to come. But when the world is about to break, no place is safe.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":440,\"title\":\"Aliens vs Predator: Requiem\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5iTwPDNtvK6ZZF607BHBbU3HO0B.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jXntuh47VtKLeoyBQ268rv24Igw.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a horrifying PredAlien crash-lands near a small Colorado town, killing everyone it encounters and producing countless Alien offspring, a lone Predator arrives to \\\"clean up\\\" the infestation.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":36648,\"title\":\"Blade: Trinity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6f7iXvPOnf83MaLB1JmPzUor1rr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/63eAFgJtN6ZTyFFzlAOoZLhlYqc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For years, Blade has fought against the vampires in the cover of the night. But now, after falling into the crosshairs of the FBI, he is forced out into the daylight, where he is driven to join forces with a clan of human vampire hunters he never knew existed—The Nightstalkers. Together with Abigail and Hannibal, two deftly trained Nightstalkers, Blade follows a trail of blood to the ancient creature that is also hunting him—the original vampire, Dracula.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":614696,\"title\":\"#Alive\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lZPvLUMYEPLTE2df1VW5FHTYC8N.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k2SY15W9QXH9qL8f4a4BbytV1BE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As a grisly virus rampages a city, a lone man stays locked inside his apartment, digitally cut off from seeking help and desperate to find a way out.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268673,\"title\":\"Kamen Rider Agito: Project G4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Ib5YCu3opbGlO8YuQ30tVRYnuc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJJ2Ba4n1bLl51gOb2YzPXb0m1h.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Shouichi encounters a teenage girl called Sayaka, who ran away from a military facility because of an attack by the Ant Lords. Sayaka has a supernatural ability to foresee the future. Risa Fukami, of the military group GA, wants to use that power to enhance the newly-made G4 System, which was based upon designs stolen from Ozawa.  Now, Agito and Gills must fight to stop the Ant Lords' attack, as G3 and G4 settle their score.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1041557,\"title\":\"Ultraman Connection Presents: Tamashii Nations Special Streaming featuring Ultraman Trigger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3s0aPnfgHmeYm6qpM7M2S47LEDL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ultraman Connection Presents: Tamashii Nations Special Streaming featuring Ultraman Trigger is a special filmed stage show based on various Ultraman characters and released on YouTube as a part of the eponymous stream.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"Pu0pH5BuCPM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer 3 [Subtitled]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"pWJjYoqVSjQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer 2 [Subtitled]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"-9MA9BnA7Uo\",\"name\":\"Official UK Trailer [Subtitled]\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}